SUMMARY:Sustain UNL Weekly Meeting
LOCATION:Nebraska Union
DESCRIPTION:SustainUNL holds weekly meetings every Thursday from 7-8 PM in
  the Nebraska Union. We use this time to organize community volunteering 
 and activism as well as to facilitate conversations about sustainability 
 and how we can be eco-friendly in our own lives. Everyone is welcome to a
 ttend--we love to see new faces!
URL:https://unl.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12450326
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
